  "description": "Game engine for табла, the Bulgarian family of backgammon games: обикновена (права), гюлбара, тапа, челеби and the traditional среща match. Matches are driven one action at a time, with injected dice for provably fair hosts, per-seat views, replayable match records and move helpers for user interfaces.",
