  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 (the first release)\n\n- BackgammonMatch: табла matches driven one action at a time (Start, ToMove, Validate, Act, Stop) for обикновена,\n  гюлбара, тапа, челеби and the среща rotation, played to 3 (5 for a среща) with the lead rule.\n- Every die from an injected source, in a documented order, and a record that accounts for every draw.\n- Escalating doubles from each player's 4th roll, with remainders passed to the opponent; тапа pins, the майка and\n  the double-mother draw; марс; the stuck rule.\n- Per-seat views and match records as plain JSON-serializable models; exact replay from a record.\n- BackgammonStageMoves: outcomes, legal next steps, destinations and dice left for tap-to-move boards.",
